cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CyberEpi: SEIHDR-EAKF Influenza Hospitalization Forecasting Platform"
authors:
  - name: "Avinash"
    email: "avianthonf@pm.me"
repository-code: "https://github.com/avianthonf/CyberEpi"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Automated disease surveillance and forecasting platform: a SEIHDR
  mechanistic model with ensemble square-root filter (EAKF) assimilation of
  NHSN influenza admissions and NSSP ED ILI data, plus a six-service
  FastAPI backend with differential privacy and federated learning support.
  Backtested against CDC FluSight targets (pooled relWIS 0.707 vs the CDC
  baseline across three seasons, 53 locations, 22,525 scored forecasts).
